post.description:
Runs the customer credit check. `Block` → `422 CREDIT_BLOCK`; `Override` → routed for approval with the exception flag;
`Warn` → warning returned. When no `Sales Order` rule matches the order is **confirmed immediately** (stock reserved
per `salesAutoReserveOnConfirm`, number allocated).

bearerAuth.description:
Access token issued by `POST /auth/login` (or `/auth/mfa/verify`, `/auth/invitations/{token}/accept`,
`/auth/register`). Carries `tenantId`, `userId`, role ids and the default company. Expires in 15 min;
refresh with `POST /auth/refresh`.
